async function insertImageFile(file){if(!file)return;if(file.size>5*1024*1024){toast('Image trop lourde : maximum 5 Mo par image.');return}let data=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{let r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>resolve(r.result);r.onerror=reject;r.readAsDataURL(file)});$('#docEditor').focus();document.execCommand('insertHTML',false,`<img src="${data}" alt="Capture de cours">`)}
function newQuiz(id){const old=custom.quizzes.find(x=>x.id===id);const roots=[...new Set(catalog.filter(x=>x.kind==='cours').map(x=>rootCategory(x.category)))].sort((a,b)=>moduleNumber(a)-moduleNumber(b));modal(old?'Modifier le QCM':'Créer un QCM',`<label>Nom du QCM<input class="formfield" id="qTitle" value="${esc(old?.title||'')}" placeholder="QCM Réseaux"></label><label>Module ENI<select class="formfield" id="qCat">${roots.map(x=>`<option ${x===(old?.category||activeFolder)?'selected':''} value="${esc(x)}">${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>Questions : Question | Réponse A | Réponse B | Réponse C | Numéro correct (1, 2 ou 3)</label><textarea class="formfield" id="qLines" rows="9" placeholder="Que signifie DNS ? | Domain Name System | Data Network Server | Dynamic Network Setup | 1">${esc(old?.questions?.map(z=>[z.question,...z.answers,z.correct+1].join(' | ')).join('\n')||'')}</textarea><div class="actions"><button type="button" class="btn primary" id="saveQ">Enregistrer le QCM</button><button type="button" class="btn" onclick="document.getElementById('modal').close()">Annuler</button></div>`);$('#saveQ').onclick=()=>{let title=$('#qTitle').value.trim(),questions=$('#qLines').value.split('\n').map(x=>x.split('|').map(y=>y.trim())).filter(x=>x.length===5&&[1,2,3].includes(+x[4])).map(x=>({question:x[0],answers:x.slice(1,4),correct:+x[4]-1}));if(!title||!questions.length){toast('Saisis un titre et au moins une question valide.');return}let obj={id:old?.id||'quiz-'+Date.now(),title,category:$('#qCat').value,questions};custom.quizzes=custom.quizzes.filter(x=>x.id!==obj.id);custom.quizzes.push(obj);saveLocal('quiz:'+obj.id);$('#modal').close();goto('quiz')}}
function newCheat(id){const old=(custom.cheats||[]).find(x=>x.id===id);modal(old?'Modifier la cheatsheet':'Ajouter une cheatsheet',`<label>Nom affiché sous la miniature<input class="formfield" id="cheatTitle" value="${esc(old?.title||'')}" placeholder="Commandes Linux"></label><label>Catégorie<input class="formfield" id="cheatCat" value="${esc(old?.category||'Linux / Bash')}" placeholder="Linux / Bash"></label><label>Image, PDF ou document (maximum 4 Mo)<input class="formfield" type="file" id="cheatFile" accept="image/*,.pdf,.doc,.docx,.txt"></label><div id="cheatPaste" class="cheatpaste" tabindex="0">📋 Clique ici puis Ctrl + V pour coller une capture d'écran</div><div class="actions"><button type="button" class="btn primary" id="saveCheat">Enregistrer</button><button type="button" class="btn" id="cancelCheat">Annuler</button></div>`);let fileData=old?.data||'',mime=old?.mime||'',fileName=old?.fileName||'';const load=async file=>{if(!file)return;if(file.size>4*1024*1024){toast('Fichier trop volumineux (maximum 4 Mo).');return}mime=file.type||'application/octet-stream';fileName=file.name;fileData=await new Promise(resolve=>{let r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>resolve(r.result);r.readAsDataURL(file)});$('#cheatPaste').textContent='✓ '+fileName};$('#cheatFile').onchange=e=>load(e.target.files[0]);$('#cheatPaste').onpaste=e=>{let f=[...e.clipboardData.items].find(x=>x.type.startsWith('image/'))?.getAsFile();if(f){e.preventDefault();load(f)}};$('#cancelCheat').onclick=()=>$('#modal').close();$('#saveCheat').onclick=()=>{let title=$('#cheatTitle').value.trim();if(!title||!fileData){toast('Ajoute un titre et un fichier.');return}let obj={id:old?.id||'cheat-'+Date.now(),title,category:$('#cheatCat').value.trim()||'Divers',data:fileData,mime,fileName};custom.cheats=custom.cheats||[];custom.cheats=custom.cheats.filter(x=>x.id!==obj.id);custom.cheats.push(obj);saveLocal('cheat:'+obj.id);$('#modal').close();goto('cheats')}}
